  "status": "verified-sample",
  "coverage": "complete",
  "notes": [
    "Action ids are REST paths with {placeholders} that are replaced by options of the same name (livepremier.js actioncb); they are not plain identifiers.",
    "Fire-and-forget over HTTP POST: the module has no feedbacks (companion/HELP.md).",
    "The module marks itself as kept for compatibility only and points to analogway-awj as the replacement (getConfigFields in livepremier.js).",
    "Built on @companion-module/base 1.x: no expressions.",
    "Memory ids and source ids are plain number fields with fixed bounds; they are not checked against the device."
  ],
